title: "DocTalk Corpus Analysis"
abstract: "Reproducible analysis pipeline for a German-language corpus of interprofessional clinical chat communication collected in the DocTalk project. The repository includes source code, corpus-specific cleaning rules, aggregated public results, publication figures, and a fully synthetic demonstration dataset; the confidential source corpus is not included."
